  "description": "Persistence (ECO report X2): do `cast off`, the turnover and the reserve survive a reload? Four scripted cases on the lake fort, one cell each: castoff (cast off + save + reload: F2), midseason (reload 20,000 ticks into summer: the turnover is a standing rule after a same-season reload, F6), prechange (reload 2,000 ticks before the change, then cross it), refund (send groups off 2 days before the change, cross it; reserve plus quantity per entry before and after: F7). Analyse reports reserve conservation from the state dumps.",
